# Benchmark: objects
# Workload: one instance of a custom type and one plain thing, each read and
# written 300 times. Measures property access and property assignment.
# (A typed thing cannot be re-declared under the same name, so the workload
# reuses one instance rather than creating instances in a loop.)

a Person has
    name
    age

jeff is a Person with name "Jeff", age 0
thing has counter 0, label "bench"

count from 1 to 300 as n
    current is age of jeff
    age of jeff is current plus 1
    other is counter of thing
    counter of thing is other plus 2
.
say "objects" age of jeff counter of thing
